no! a ghost only has 1 existence.  when you defeat it, it's gone.
you get a ghost for each dead character that leaves bones (normally ...).
what you may have noticed are ghosts piling up on a particularly deadly
level.  it is not unusual in a "single player" dungeon to come across
your ghosts a lot.  too bad it isn't possible for players of the same
game on similar machines to exchange bones, that would add spice.

